pt\">曜石黑</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-opt\">珍珠白</button></div></div><div id=\"contact\" class=\"pm-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-primary pm-btn\">立即预订</button><a href=\"/zh/rental-hosting\" class=\"pm-btn pm-btn-gold\">咨询租赁托管</a><a href=\"/zh/franchise\" class=\"btn-dark pm-btn\">加入门店加盟</a></div><div class=\"pm-trust\"><span>✓ 正品设备</span><span>✓ 全球配送</span><span>✓ 安装培训</span><span>✓ 售后服务</span></div></div></section></div></header><section id=\"detail\" class=\"pm-section\"><div class=\"pm-wrap\"><div class=\"pm-tabs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-tab pm-tab-active\">商品详情</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-tab\">规格参数</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-tab\">产品视频</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-tab\">客户评价</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-tab\">相关推荐</button></div><div class=\"pm-content\"><div class=\"pm-tab-panel\"><div class=\"pm-richtext\"><p>AI能量波理疗机器人</p><p>AI PHYSIOTHERAPY ROBOT</p><p>深层理疗 · 智能修复 · 精准康养</p><p>科技赋能健康</p><p>AI智能中击波理疗技术</p><p>AI智能中击波理疗机器人，以人体筋膜学理论为基础，结合AI智能算法与精准定位系统，实现智能识别、精准施治，为用户提供更加科学、高效、舒适的健康理疗体验。</p><p>通过高能中击波作用于人体深层组织，可有效舒缓肌肉紧张、促进血液循环、改善软组织状态，帮助恢复身体活力。</p><p>六大核心优势</p><p>✅ AI智能识别</p><p>智能识别人体不同部位，自动匹配理疗参数，操作简单、安全高效。</p><p>✅ 深层渗透8cm</p><p>高能中击波可深入约8cm组织层，作用更深、更精准。</p><p>✅ 精准打散粘连</p><p>帮助改善筋膜粘连、肌肉僵硬，提升身体灵活性。</p><p>✅ 激活循环</p><p>促进局部微循环，帮助组织恢复，改善身体状态。</p><p>✅ 柔性压力控制</p><p>智能调节输出力度，让理疗过程更加舒适稳定。</p><p>✅ 个性化定制</p><p>根据不同身体部位及需求，自动匹配理疗方案。</p></div><div class=\"pm-features mt-8\"><div class=\"pm-feature\"><div class=\"pm-ico\">🧠</div><h3>智能程序控制</h3><p>支持多种程序、时间及力度选择，适合标准化门店服务。</p></div><div class=\"pm-feature\"><div class=\"pm-ico\">🦾</div><h3>商用稳定运行</h3><p>面向高频商业场景设计，适合理疗中心及连锁门店。</p></div><div class=\"pm-feature\"><div class=\"pm-ico\">📊</div><h3>连接运营系统</h3><p>可连接会员、预约、支付、客户管理与门店经营数据。</p></div></div></div><div id=\"specs\" class=\"pm-tab-panel\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"pm-spec-grid\"><div class=\"pm-spec-item\">品牌：CUCA</div><div class=\"pm-spec-item\">产品类型：AI按摩机器人</div><div class=\"pm-spec-item\">应用场景：商用 / 家用</div><div class=\"pm-spec-item\">控制方式：智能触控</div><div class=\"pm-spec-item\">服务支持：安装培训</div><div class=\"pm-spec-item\">保修期限：12个月</div><div class=\"pm-spec-item\">配送范围：全球</div><div class=\"pm-spec-item\">语言：中英文</div><div class=\"pm-spec-item\">运营系统：可连接会员后台</div></div></div><div id=\"video\" class=\"pm-tab-panel\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"pm-video\"><h2>产品操作视频 / Product Demonstration</h2><div class=\"pm-videobox\"><video controls=\"\" playsinline=\"\" preload=\"metadata\"><source src=\"https://www.airobot2028.com/profile/upload/2026/09/07/AI%E5%86%B2%E5%87%BB%E6%B3%A2%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA_20260907150233A006.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><p class=\"pm-video-hint\">产品演示视频</p></div></div><div id=\"reviews\" class=\"pm-tab-panel\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"pm-reviews\"><h2 class=\"pm-reviews-title\">客户评价 / Customer Reviews</h2><div class=\"pm-reviewbox\"><div><div class=\"pm-score\">—</div><div class=\"pm-stars text-center\">☆☆☆☆☆</div><p class=\"text-center text-sm text-[#9fb2c9] mt-2\">0 条评价</p><!----></div><div class=\"pm-review-form\"><div class=\"pm-gtitle\">发表评价</div><p class=\"text-sm text-[#9fb2c9] mb-3\">请到「已完成」订单详情页提交评价。</p><a href=\"/zh/orders\" class=\"btn-primary inline-block\">前往我的订单</a></div></div><div class=\"pm-tab-empty mt-5\">暂无评价，来写第一条吧。</div></div></div><div class=\"pm-tab-panel\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"pm-tab-empty\">相关推荐请查看下方更多产品。</div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"recommend\" class=\"pm-section\"><div class=\"pm-wrap\"><div class=\"text-center mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-black\">更多产品</h2></div><div class=\"pm-recommend\"><a href=\"/zh/products/2\" class=\"pm-rec\"><div class=\"pm-recimg\"><img src=\"https://www.airobot2028.com/profile/upload/2026/09/07/%E8%89%BE%E7%81%B81_20260907182406A013.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-[inherit]\"></div><div class=\"pm-recbody\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-lg\">AI艾灸机器人</h3